[20909]={e="A strike that becomes active after parrying an opponent's attack. This attack deals $s2% weapon damage plus $m1 and immobilizes the target for $d. Counterattack cannot be blocked, dodged, or parried.",ea="Immobile.",n="Motattack",d="Ett slag som blir aktivt efter att du har parerat en fiendes attack. Attacken orsakar $s2 % vapenskada plus $m1 och rotar fast målet i $d. Motattack kan inte blockeras, undvikas eller pareras.",a="Orörlig."},
